        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='35750' id='14' type-v2='text' w='34375' x='61563' y='55125'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>This map visualizes safety compliance across our global ground handling network. By plotting the aggregate incident rate against total flight volume, it identifies geographical risk zones. This intelligence enables the central operations team to move away from random inspections and intelligently deploy safety auditors to high-risk hubs.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>This dual-axis analysis contrasts turnaround volume against safety incident frequency. The data reveals a critical operational insight: a distinct &quot;Risk Spike&quot; occurs on the left side of the distribution. It proves that when ground crews are rushed and forced into a negative variance state to beat their targets, the probability of severe safety protocol breaches increases significantly.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12250' id='15' type-v2='text' w='38828' x='4141' y='2875'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='22'>Safety Ground Ops &amp; Audit Engine</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='6500' id='16' type-v2='dashboard-object' w='12813' x='44688' y='5625'>
